<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="825343"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1539323019"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="My Dearest"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="supercell"/><amll:meta key="album" value="My Dearest"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:38.520"><div begin="00:01.065" end="05:13.034"><p begin="00:01.065" end="00:03.945" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">So, everything that makes me whole<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我愿将造就我生命的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyoku：ryo</span></p><p begin="00:03.945" end="00:10.172" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">今君に捧げよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻全都献给你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ima kimi ni sasa ge yo u</span></p><p begin="00:11.807" end="00:15.025" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">I'm Yours<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我属于你</span></p><p begin="00:35.602" end="00:43.075" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">ねえ こんなに笑えたこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 如此开心的欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e ko n na ni wara e ta ko to</span></p><p begin="00:43.941" end="00:48.586" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">生まれて初めてだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有生以来初次体会到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma re te haji me te da yo</span></p><p begin="00:49.650" end="00:55.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">きっと私はね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想必我一定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to watashi wa ne</span></p><p begin="00:56.921" end="01:05.962" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">この日の為に間違いだらけの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是为了这一天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no hi no tame ni ma chiga i da ra ke no</span></p><p begin="01:06.731" end="01:11.749" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">道を歩いてきたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才在遍布错误的路上走到如今</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">michi wo aru i te ki ta n da</span></p><p begin="01:12.455" end="01:18.553" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">ずっと一人で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孤身一人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to hito ri de</span></p><p begin="01:20.304" end="01:24.095" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">遠く遠くどこまでも遠く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论多么遥远的远方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">too ku too ku do ko ma de mo too ku</span></p><p begin="01:24.095" end="01:29.535" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">君と二人 手を取って永遠に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要能永远和你手牵着手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi to futa ri te wo to 't te ei en ni</span></p><p begin="01:29.535" end="01:34.672" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">どこまでだって行けるはず<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就能够去往任何地方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de da 't te yu ke ru ha zu</span></p><p begin="01:34.672" end="01:41.167" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">もう一人じゃないと君はそう言い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说你再也不会让我孤独</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u hito ri ja na i to kimi wa so u i i</span></p><p begin="01:41.167" end="01:47.133" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">また笑う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次对我微笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta wara u</span></p><p begin="01:49.882" end="01:55.489" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">守るべき大事なものが今あって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你面对应该守护的重要事物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mamo ru be ki dai ji na mo no ga ima a 't te</span></p><p begin="01:55.489" end="02:01.144" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">だけど成すすべもなく立ち尽くす時は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却无能为力只能久久伫立之时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ke do naru su su be mo na ku ta chi tsu ku su toki wa</span></p><p begin="02:01.144" end="02:08.183" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">可能性を失って暗闇が君を覆い隠し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你失去了选择被黑暗所笼罩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka nou sei wo ushina 't te kura yami ga kimi wo oo i kaku shi</span></p><p begin="02:08.183" end="02:12.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">絶望に飲みこまれそうな時は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你就快被绝望所吞噬的时候</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zetsu bou ni no mi ko ma re so u na toki wa</span></p><p begin="02:12.740" end="02:18.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">私が君を照らす明りになるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿化作为你照亮前路的光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">watashi ga kimi wo te ra su aka ri ni na ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:18.460" end="02:23.815" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">たとえこの世界の王にだって消せはしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使世界之王也无法将我掩盖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tato e ko no se kai no ou ni da 't te ke se wa shi na i</span></p><p begin="02:23.815" end="02:26.799" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">So, everything that makes me whole<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我愿将造就我生命的一切</span></p><p begin="02:26.799" end="02:33.472" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">今君に捧げよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻全都献给你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ima kimi ni sasa ge yo u</span></p><p begin="02:34.594" end="02:37.176" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">I'm Yours<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我属于你</span></p><p begin="02:41.408" end="02:49.294" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">ねえ この世界にはたくさんの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 在这个广阔世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e ko no se kai ni wa ta ku sa n no</span></p><p begin="02:49.683" end="02:54.891" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">幸せがあるんだね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有着许许多多的幸福</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi a wa se ga a ru n da ne</span></p><p begin="02:55.380" end="03:01.295" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">いつか二人なら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们两人也总有一天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka futa ri na ra</span></p><p begin="03:04.173" end="03:09.828" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">誰かが君のことを嘘つきと呼んで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使有谁认为你说的全是谎言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">dare ka ga kimi no ko to wo uso tsu ki to yo n de</span></p><p begin="03:09.828" end="03:15.499" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">心無い言葉で傷つけようとしても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使他们用残忍话语将你伤害</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kokoro na i koto ba de kizu tsu ke yo u to shi te mo</span></p><p begin="03:15.499" end="03:21.054" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">世界が君のことを信じようともせずに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使全世界都不相信你的真心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se kai ga kimi no ko to wo shin ji yo u to mo se zu ni</span></p><p begin="03:21.054" end="03:26.982" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">茨の冠を被せようとしても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使他们要给你戴上荆棘之冠</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ibara no kanmuri wo kabu se yo u to shi te mo</span></p><p begin="03:26.982" end="03:32.702" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">私は君だけの味方になれるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也愿站在你的身边将你庇护</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">watashi wa kimi da ke no mi kata ni na re ru yo</span></p><p begin="03:32.702" end="03:38.164" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">その孤独 痛みを私は知っている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我早已经知晓你的孤独和痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ko doku ita mi wo watashi wa shi 't te i ru</span></p><p begin="03:38.164" end="03:40.964" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">So, everything that makes me whole<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我愿将造就我生命的一切</span></p><p begin="03:40.964" end="03:46.772" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">今君に捧げよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻全都献给你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ima kimi ni sasa ge yo u</span></p><p begin="03:48.781" end="03:51.997" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">I'm Yours<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我属于你</span></p><p begin="04:24.139" end="04:29.774" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">いつか私を知ることができたなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若有一天你终于明白我的心意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka watashi wo shi ru ko to ga de ki ta na ra</span></p><p begin="04:29.774" end="04:35.561" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">必ずその場所に私はいるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我必定会在那个地方将你守候</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kanara zu so no ba sho ni watashi wa i ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="04:35.561" end="04:41.049" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">そこに希望の欠片すらなかったとしても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使那里连丝毫的希望都没有</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ko ni ki bou no kake ra su ra na ka 't ta to shi te mo</span></p><p begin="04:41.049" end="04:46.842" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">私が在ってはならないものであっても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使我变成了世所不容的存在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">watashi ga i te wa na ra na i mo no de a 't te mo</span></p><p begin="04:46.842" end="04:52.671" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">君は忘れないでいてくれることを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我相信你也永远不会将我忘记</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi wa wasu re na i de i te ku re ru ko to wo</span></p><p begin="04:52.671" end="04:58.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">誰よりも私がそのことを知ってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我比任何人都清楚明白这一点</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">dare yo ri mo watashi ga so no ko to wo shi 't te ru</span></p><p begin="04:58.390" end="05:03.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">だから私は君のために全てを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我愿为你而将自己的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra watashi wa kimi no ta me ni sube te wo</span></p><p begin="05:03.970" end="05:13.034" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">今 捧ごう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻全都献给你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ima sasa go u</span></p></div></body></tt>